!paper/Seq2Lead_scientific_manuscript.docx

# Third-party binaries and local tooling. Present in the working tree, absent
# from the review pack, and matched by nothing above -- without this the 1.1 MB
# AutoDock Vina executable would be committed.
tools/

# Large local result files that are NOT part of the approved allow-list. Named
# explicitly because  already excludes them and no negation should
# ever reach them.
reports/results/baseline_runs.json

# The closeout prompt is working material, not part of the public-facing tree.
# Untracked in the final-review pass; a copy is preserved outside the repository
# and its location and digest are recorded in docs/ATTRIBUTION.md's sibling
# checklist (docs/BACKUP_CHECKLIST.md). History is NOT rewritten to remove it.
docs/CLAUDE_CLOSEOUT_PROMPT.md
